<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Homunculus</ansi> mutation

The final work of the self-made -- you craft a living copy of
yourself to fight at your side.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Transformation (apex)
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Apex
<ansi fg="yellow">Requires:</ansi> Walking Chrysalis and Faithwrought

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  A boss-tier copy of you is forged and fights at your side, its
  might scaling with how much you have mastered your crafts. It
  wakes on its own, and reforges itself a while after it falls.

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Sustaining your great work claims nearly all your conviction --
  it is, in truth, the only companion you will have room for

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
